# Signups by week

Every visual block must have its data reachable as a table. The first chart
takes the default and renders a collapsed `details`; the second asks for the
table to be visible, because the exact figures are the point.

```mdv bar
title: Signups by week
x: week
y: signups
---
week,signups
W-31,1204
W-32,1388
W-33,1291
W-34,1502
```

```mdv line
title: Signups by week
x: week
y: signups
table: visible
---
week,signups
W-31,1204
W-32,1388
W-33,1291
W-34,1502
```
